{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123401","id":4503507880,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDG4TqA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123401","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123401.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123401.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123401","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123401/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123401/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123401/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bceb734401f7ab6f18522d9792384b5731868ef3","number":123401,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Auto-reimport translation csv files after saving in the editor","user":{"login":"TheJosh","id":1219314,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTkzMTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1219314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJosh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJosh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"For short strings and only one or two languages (e.g. early dev) it's pretty easy to edit the csv files directly within the editor.\r\n\r\nAfter editing you always then need to re-import the CSV file to regenerate the translations. Instead, we can auto-reimport to greatly improve turnaround time.\r\n\r\nAI was used as a search engine to help find suitable methods `get_import_order_threads_and_importer` and `reimport_files`. All other work is my own.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSpeeds up iteration of translations especially small tweaks to strings, adding additional string codes, and smaller projects where the spreadsheets are not too large.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nI created a small project with a label and a few strings in a strings file. I've set the preview to [en] and the label to one of my strings. Then edited the strings file and saved using CTRL+S, saw a reimport popup, and also saw that my label had changed.\r\n\r\nAdded a gdscript file, edited this in the editor, saved the file, there wasn't a reimport popup.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"op